    LLM: 'Game: 2-7 Triple Draw. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '2-7 Triple Draw (Deuce to Seven) is a lowball draw poker game where the lowest hand wins. Players get five cards and three drawing rounds to improve; straights and flushes count against you; aces are high. Best possible hand is 7-5-4-3-2 offsuit.',
